			"name": "Succubus's Mastery",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The champion of the arena: a Wych who has won more fights than any other and is prepared to die keeping the title. Codex: Drukhari's Succubus and Wych Cult background.\n\nDesign: 85 + 15 + 15 + 20 + 10 + 10 = 155 points, added to Wych Training (115) and the baseline (150) for 420 points before lens, mental traits, Power from Pain and skills.",
