					"local_notes": "DX +1, melee attacks and parries only.\n\nLore: A concentrate that heightens perception and reflexes, sharpening a Wych's blows and parries.\n\nDesign: Increased DX +1 (B15, 20 points) with Accessibility -30% (one dose) and -40% (melee attack and parry rolls only): 20 x 0.3 = 6 points.",
