					"id": "tqqbvcFtndEIcLUSo",
					"name": "Painbringer Numbness",
					"reference": "B59",
					"local_notes": "High Pain Threshold. Does not stack with Power from Pain (Stage I).\n\nLore: A nerve-deadening drug: the Wych feels nothing until the fight is done and the damage arrives all at once.\n\nDesign: High Pain Threshold (B59, 10 points) with the one-dose Accessibility: 7 points.",
