		{
			"id": "TahWOP-FSK6uGY4IJ",
			"name": "Combat Drug: Splintermind",
			"local_notes": "One dose per combat. Enable the trait for the fight; lasts the whole fight (about ten minutes at most). Roll HT after the fight ends; on a failure lose 1 FP and take -1 on all rolls for an hour (the comedown).\n\nLore: Splintermind is the mental drug of the six: a hard, focused calm. Background: Codex: Drukhari's Wych Cult drug list. Its exact effect varies by edition, so this is the project's choice, not a fixed lore fact.\n\nDesign: Will only; no bonus to skills. Net 7 - 5 = 2 points when enabled.",
